    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17975" root="زلج" body-key="z">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزلّج</span></b>  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, slipped,</i> or <i>slid along</i> or
<i>down;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَزَلَّقَ</span>: (S, TA:) <i>his foot slipped.</i>
(KL. [See also 5 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زلخ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One says of
an arrow, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتَزَلَّجُ عَنِ القَوْسِ</span> or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنْزَلِجُ</span></b>  [<i>It slips
from the bow</i>]. (S and K, accord. to different
copies.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>He persevered,</i> or <i>persisted, in
drinking</i> the beverage called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِيذ</span>, (Lh, K, TA,)
and wine; (Lh, TA;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسلّج</span>. (TA.)

